\qquad j=n,n-1,\ldots,1.
$$
These waiting times concern disjoint successive blocks of independent rolls, so they are independent. Thus the <coupon collector problem> has the decomposition
$$
\boxed{T_n=\sum_{j=1}^nG_j}.
